{
  "id": "note-from-the-author",
  "kind": "introduction",
  "sourceKind": "author-note",
  "label": "Note from the Author",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "sourceRange": [
    67,
    136
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 67
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you are reading this..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 68
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "thank you."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 69
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not just for picking up this book."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 70
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But for being willing to pause."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 71
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "In a world that constantly asks us to move faster..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "achieve more..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "become more..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and chase the next thing..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the simple act of stopping and looking is becoming increasingly rare."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This series was born from that act."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not from certainty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not from expertise."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 79
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And not from the belief that I had answers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was born from questions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 81
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions that refused to leave."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions about thought."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 83
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions about identity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 84
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions about suffering."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions about meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 86
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions about what it truly means to be human."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 87
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Over time, those questions became pages."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 88
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Those pages became books."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 89
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And those books became a journey."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 90
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A journey through the human mind."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 91
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A journey through paradoxes."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 92
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A journey through stories."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 93
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And finally..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 94
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "a journey into the structure of the human experience itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 95
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "While writing these books, I discovered something unexpected."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The deeper I went searching for answers..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 97
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the more I found myself returning to observation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 98
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not conclusions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 99
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not beliefs."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Observation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because sometimes the most important things in life are not hidden."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "They are simply overlooked."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This series is not an attempt to tell you what is true."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is an invitation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "An invitation to look."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To question."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To observe."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And perhaps..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "to see something familiar with fresh eyes."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If these pages have given you comfort during difficult moments..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "clarity during confusing moments..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "or simply a moment of honest reflection..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "then they have already done more than I could have hoped for."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And if they have left you with more questions than answers..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that may not be a failure."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It may be the beginning of a deeper conversation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A conversation not with this book."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But with yourself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Wherever you are in your journey..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "whether you are searching..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "healing..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "questioning..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "growing..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "or simply trying to understand your place in the world..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I hope you remember one thing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You do not need to have everything figured out."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You do not need to become a perfect version of yourself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And you do not need to carry every story forever."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Sometimes..."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it is enough to be here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To breathe."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To observe."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And to allow life to unfold."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you for sharing this journey with me."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lalit R. Mishra"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 136
    }
  ],
  "index": 5,
